# A module in this Juicebox admin

This admin is built on `<%= lib %>`. Its modules follow that library's module guide.

1. Read `node_modules/<%= lib %>/<%= guide %>` in full before you write or restructure a module, and follow it.
2. Start a new module with the generator, then fill the skeleton in:

   ```
   ng g <%= lib %>:module <name> --label "<Name staff read>" --role <role> --service <backend service>
   ```

3. This project's own `CLAUDE.md` still applies; where it is stricter than the guide, it wins.
